title: Internal Security
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: police_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and police_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/SeveringCarl.jpg

= Internal Security

The Interior Ministry controls internal security throughout the Republic - the Civil Guard inherited from the monarchy, and the new Assault Guard (Guardia de Asalto) created in 1931 as a force meant to be loyal to the Republic itself. While the Ministry is not in PSOE hands, we retain considerable influence over how vigorously it acts.

As with the officer corps, elements of the police - the Civil Guard above all - remain wary of the Republic, and their loyalty cannot always be taken for granted.

- @loyalty: Improve the loyalty of the internal security forces.
- @investigate_corruption: Investigate corruption among landowners resisting land reform.
- @investigate_far_right: Investigate conspiracy among the far right.
- @domestic_enemies: Investigate or ban our domestic enemies.
- @root: Take no action for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@loyalty
on-arrival: interior_police_loyalty += 0.1

There are measures we can take to root out reactionary and anti-republican sentiment in the police. We can improve training and recruiting procedures, and identify and remove known conspirators and sympathizers of the far right.

Current police loyalty: [+ interior_police_loyalty : loyalty +]


@investigate_corruption
go-to: investigate_corruption_success if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.5; investigate_corruption_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.5

@investigate_corruption_success
on-arrival: investigate_corruption += 1; industrial_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); inflation -= 0.1 if inflation > 3; inflation -= 0.2 if inflation >= 8; radical_relation -= 3; izq_rep_relation -= 1

Corruption among landowners and industrialists evading land reform and labor law is, of course, rampant. Publicizing the scandals we uncover brings new attention to the Interior Ministry's work, and to the PSOE's role in pressing for it.


@investigate_corruption_failure

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by sympathizers within the police.

@investigate_far_right
go-to: investigate_far_right_success if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.55; investigate_far_right_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.55

@investigate_far_right_success
on-arrival: investigate_far_right += 1; falange_militia_strength *= 0.96; falange_militia_strength *= 0.96 if investigate_far_right == 2; industrial_falange -= 1; urban_middle_falange -= 2; nazi_urgency += 1 if investigate_far_right == 2; nazi_urgency += 2 if investigate_far_right == 3; industrial_falange -= 2 if investigate_far_right == 3; urban_middle_falange -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; smallholder_falange -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; unemployed_psoe += 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; coup_progress -= 1 if coup_progress >= 6

[? if investigate_far_right == 1 : We have discovered contacts between sympathetic bankers and the Falange. This is very useful information. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right == 2 : We have discovered illegal arms smuggling by the Falangist militia. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right == 3 : We have discovered a cache of documents from disaffected army officers detailing a plan to rise against the Republic by force. This is an anti-constitutional plot, and will be publicized and prosecuted. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right > 3 : Of course the conspirators are still plotting; everyone with eyes can see it. Now we finally have proof of some of it. ?]

[? if coup_progress >= 6: There are reports of an imminent rising by the far right. We have disrupted some of these plans, but the threat is still present. ?]

@investigate_far_right_failure

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by sympathizers within the police.
